\newlabel{tab:identifiability}{{8}{8}{Identifiability phase diagram: 95\% CI width for $\gamma $ by signal AUC and number of models $N$. \cmark = CI $<$ 0.15 (identifiable); \xmark = CI $\geq $ 0.15 (unidentifiable). Current LLM evaluation conditions ($N\leq 16$, AUC $\leq 0.85$) fall in the unidentifiable region}{table.8}{}}
